-10-24&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DN6ZLzzAZ&#95;nQ%26t%3D46s&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AInternational+Organization+for+Standardization\" class=\"Z3988\"></span> 0:53, Prof. Sankai: \"We couldn't have done it without ISO <span class=\"rt-commentedText nowrap\"><span class=\"IPA nopopups noexcerpt\" lang=\"en-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:IPA/English\" title=\"Help:IPA/English\">/<span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"/aɪ/: &#39;i&#39; in &#39;tide&#39;\">aɪ</span></span><span class=\"wrap\"> </span><span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"/ɛ/: &#39;e&#39; in &#39;dress&#39;\">ɛ</span><span title=\"&#39;s&#39; in &#39;sigh&#39;\">s</span></span><span class=\"wrap\"> </span><span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"/oʊ/: &#39;o&#39; in &#39;code&#39;\">oʊ</span></span>/</a></span></span>.\" 0:56, narrator: \"ISO <span class=\"rt-commentedText nowrap\"><span class=\"IPA nopopups noexcerpt\" lang=\"en-fonipa\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help:IPA/English\" title=\"Help:IPA/English\">/<span style=\"border-bottom:1px dotted\"><span title=\"/ˈ/: primary stress follows\">ˈ</span><span title=\"/aɪ/: &#39;i&#39; in &#39;tide&#39;\">aɪ</span><span title=\"&#39;s&#39; in &#39;sigh&#39;\">s</span><span title=\"/oʊ/: &#39;o&#39; in &#39;code&#39;\">oʊ</span></span>/</a></span></span> standards ...\" <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220214062815/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N6ZLzzAZ_nQ&amp;t=63s\">Archived</a> 14 February 2022 at the Wayback Machine (not including video).</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-UIA-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-UIA_6-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFStaff&#95;writer2024\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Staff writer (2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://uia.org/s/or/en/1100016492\">\"International Organization for Standardization (ISO)\"</a>. UIA Global Civil Society Database. <i>uia.org</i>. Brussels, Belgium: <a href=\"/wiki/Union_of_International_Associations\" title=\"Union of International Associations\">Union of International Associations</a>. Yearbook of International Organizations Online<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">1 February</span> 2025</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=uia.org&amp;rft.atitle=International+Organization+for+Standardization+%28ISO%29&amp;rft.date=2024&amp;rft.au=Staff+writer&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fuia.org%2Fs%2For%2Fen%2F1100016492&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AInternational+Organization+for+Standardization\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.iso.org/publication/PUB100399.html\">\"ISO Membership Manual\"</a>. <i>ISO</i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220410094647/https://www.iso.org/publication/PUB100399.html\">Archived</a> from the original on 10 April 2022<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">10 April</span> 2022</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=ISO&amp;rft.atitle=ISO+Membership+Manual&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.iso.org%2Fpublication%2FPUB100399.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AInternational+Organization+for+Standardization\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-statutes-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-statutes_8-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation book cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.iso.org/files/live/sites/isoorg/files/archive/pdf/en/statutes.pdf\"><i>ISO Statutes</i></a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> (in English, French, and Russian) (20th&#160;ed.). <a href=\"/wiki/Vernier,_Switzerland\" title=\"Vernier, Switzerland\">Vernier, Switzerland</a>: International Organization for Standardization. 2022. <a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-92-67-02040-2\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-92-67-02040-2\"><bdi>978-92-67-02040-2</bdi></a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20220331214602/https://www.iso.org/files/live/sites/isoorg/files/archive/pdf/en/statutes.pdf\">Archived</a> <span class=\"cs1-format\">(PDF)</span> from the original on 31 March 2022<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">12 April</span> 2022</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=ISO+Statutes&amp;rft.place=Vernier%2C+Switzerland&amp;rft.edition=20th&amp;rft.pub=International+Organization+for+Standardization&amp;rft.date=2022&amp;rft.isbn=978-92-67-02040-2&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.iso.org%2Ffiles%2Flive%2Fsites%2Fisoorg%2Ffiles%2Farchive%2Fpdf%2Fen%2Fstatutes.pdf&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AInternational+Organization+for+Standardization\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-About&#95;ISO-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#ci